#: scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e234a66bb178064f5427526cffb78e89f92550152fc6ec044020358d3bb6ad61
#. default-sha256: bdf214d2eb5ae69e41660e817dfe1d3e97140235a7d129a63008f12005d4b985
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a lot of pressure being under that much suspicion, huh. ⟪k:3⟫My heart was "
"pounding the whole time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Che pressione venire osservati con un tale sospetto, eh? ⟪k:3⟫Mi batteva il cuore "
"per tutto il tempo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75604377f3caa8134525f37aec3d5839945ae760a0e63bbd4320bdc1ad02394e
#. default-sha256: 154dd1798cab8fdd05370c6c493f855ad7a14d444fc4adae5b3c4d74fce7aa87
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why’d you tell him that, anyway?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perché gli hai detto una cosa simile?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58bc5b65968f6272047d47bf18d7af6ce226da0647a3251685e11d26bd57a40c
#. default-sha256: ed2a66680a07ecec40ffc479d87ee0eee7e7d84abd873b3319c3f3599075ed6f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know, I know!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Besides, you have every intention of keeping your "
"promise, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lo so, lo so!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫E poi, hai intenzione di mantenere la tua promessa, no?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa990676654d1e44e02f2888f1f96bad00b122adfcad04b89084c7ea787cc967
#. default-sha256: d7110ae97e2b10e0f24c9c62c29fa68b93520cf1a2cc00462b4a2f10004c7197
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe, oh, you. You say it’s all on him,⟪k:3⟫but deep down, you know you’re on "
"his side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe, oh, Michel. Dici che dipende tutto da lui,⟪k:3⟫ma in fondo, sei dalla sua "
"parte."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89eb7ae917555783ba56c65a7349164e7ccb6e158cad8095ba68c527eadae836
#. default-sha256: 6e58feed4d3328c1431e9f46aba919cc7ea7fd8d6e9754ed4319a70216b1a1e7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re complete strangers to this Mell,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but I can’t bring myself to think "
"of him that way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Siamo dei perfetti estranei per Mell, in quest’epoca,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫eppure non riesco a "
"vederlo come uno sconosciuto."

#: scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a0c56bcb302cdda4ba5c5f38d64d1d458786a94a183f4eb83566e7431d2c880
#. default-sha256: 054fc0373ef299fbaa86ebf52c4c284b16e6d0575b6a3efaccc4e58c605e4288
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And you were actually there—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a part of his life—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫which I "
"imagine makes the sentiment all the stronger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E tu eri proprio lì,⟪k:3⟫ eri parte della sua vita.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Immagino che questo "
"renda il sentimento più forte."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a4a962714fc9fbdf80256de159c673aedb86c9bb0c973711f4d2ade4d4d939f
#. default-sha256: 2c0d95fcd4c06756da73a995323837da2db59700720046e48b93f559e431dcfb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫don’t think of him... ⟪k:3⟫as a total stranger, no.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫However..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non penso a lui... ⟪k:3⟫come ad un estraneo, no.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Però..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd26575192cc6f6222555612acaf6e1f204e9101d22922aa06aade02ab9b066d
#. default-sha256: 1ca6ae84d1bdae716cd02d646fe453a0414cbd4d01239b2c0715465cf854b138
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s hard to say... ⟪k:3⟫but even if he doesn’t,⟪k:4⟫we still have the other two "
"men to worry about."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ difficile dirlo... ⟪k:5⟫ma anche se non dovesse arrivare⟪k:6⟫a tanto, "
"avremmo comunque gli altri due di cui preoccuparci."

