#: scenario8:scenario8_456D304C_18F8_49FE_B699_BB8FB0129127
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33ace35c7f0d07896512861bfae36371520c9623a7caa8a1d2d231dd0781fff2
