msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_456D304C_18F8_49FE_B699_BB8FB0129127"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He bears a great deal of regret.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He yearns for someone to save him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nutre un enorme rammarico.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Desidera qualcuno che lo salvi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbf18ce6f1d100ffc96937d2f7feaa88d977dd6e945414f1765f15632081683e
#. default-sha256: 377bdcba671ccbfbcf4e4cfbc85dbcc364c5e9ef059324349013363b443f3492
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard him muttering, “This isn’t what I wanted.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He doesn’t want to be "
"involved in this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫L’avevo sentito mormorare tra sé.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Diceva “Non è questo ciò che volevo”.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Non vuole essere coivolto in questa storia."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bf9ba7f8c92d63d507c0dce4f8565701af64414ece0eac899a0ffbfb55a65dd
#. default-sha256: 41ebe5359d50514d47341ef81c9f1c4b9fee25b0cb8f86b266762b4c2a30dd8f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But we have knowledge—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫quite a bit of it, in fact."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma conosciamo i fatti—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e anche molto bene."

#: scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 157ba90d355cf01dd6e7ed835d36dd097ef15a50eba19fcbadfc119683ccb090
#. default-sha256: 8561a45239ec1211d46ab74d3427ba03c4809049f215bc04ff601b727f73ebf1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I agree! If his darling sister tells him to stop,⟪k:3⟫he won’t have any reason to "
"continue his involvement!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sono d’accordo!⟪k:3⟫ Se sarà la sua cara sorella a dirgli di smetterla, non avrà "
"motivo di continuare a rimanere coinvolto!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0a3ff6b9883882f0f84d7bc4a651ff8e31da5f0faf2273c9c597bf8dee2dbae
#. default-sha256: b4eebb7ecd38c0533b4230cc5b38ce571a65fca6dcf05dfb15031cdd5eb9b867
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫is that people tend to keep those they care most about close by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫è che le persone di solito tengono vicino a sé⟪k:3⟫coloro a cui vogliono più bene."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C2FB13F6_DBC2_4FEE_8C81_AC7E38251B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85d2ee9db42dad9b1959a91f096bb9219164d0ba514dd5805e150ab090fc2ede
#. default-sha256: 228cf50ff625c412a45cd38fdd08e095913408cdb09fad2e9666df62867e28aa
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C2FB13F6_DBC2_4FEE_8C81_AC7E38251B75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(It would appear I have a bad tendency to focus too much on the facts.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Pare che io abbia la pessima abitudine di concentrarmi troppo sui fatti.)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_837E4EB5_6197_46D7_B145_2F8C50D9FDE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43e63fbf2702306b2e0dc2cced836f5c99ef363977df192547808f41d30d2212
