msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(That was entirely unnecessary of me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle did not need to be reminded of that.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ stato superfluo da parte mia.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Giselle non aveva bisogno che glielo "
"ricordassi.)"

