msgid "⟪k:0⟫The man is practically beaming, and judging by the vial in his hand,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫L’uomo ha un’espressione raggiante, e a giudicare dalla fiala nella sua mano,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4A9271DD_A8CC_4C84_AD1C_5E56EA43DC0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 257a55c0d1cddf36a61c7c9d00608d1ec5fb6f9fe8165548a9acfa4e8d2eee79
