msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We come from the future, so we know just how dangerous this is..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Noi veniamo dal futuro, quindi sappiamo quanto sia pericoloso..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E3C4D349_6165_42E5_9315_528017A9ED61
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82e60e7bf596b0309d42af716f96e06c360d2ec4f60e7104720a2293ece0995d
