msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Would it even be possible to convince them otherwise?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Sarà mai possibile convincerli del contrario?)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB8B7765_04C9_45CF_AB42_652FC847F601
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2065570badfa5d4c3d1cc7186c996b0ad70246df22e2307e9225e856cd3eaedf
